{"id":"40be75964448d68d","group":"88","path":"88/88-ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy Examples","display":"ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels — Arithmetical Hierarchy Examples","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels","aliases":["88-ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels"],"display":"ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels — Arithmetical Hierarchy Examples","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[88-df-sigma1-set]]","[[88-df-pi1-set]]","[[88-df-delta1-set]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-arithmetical-hierarchy-levels — Arithmetical Hierarchy Examples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd611fa3b2c1a451\" href=\"?note=fd611fa3b2c1a451\" title=\"88-df-sigma1-set\">88-df-sigma1-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b952d88439f7be8f\" href=\"?note=b952d88439f7be8f\" title=\"88-df-pi1-set\">88-df-pi1-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0268c6eeaa40247a\" href=\"?note=0268c6eeaa40247a\" title=\"88-df-delta1-set\">88-df-delta1-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (number set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0,\\Pi_1^0,\\Delta_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0,\\Pi_1^0,\\Delta_1^0\\)</span> (first hierarchy levels, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c78101abe1090034\" href=\"?note=c78101abe1090034\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}levels} \\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Sigma_1^0)\n\\land\n(\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Pi_1^0)\n\\land\n(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Delta_1^0)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}levels} \\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Sigma_1^0)\n\\land\n(\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Pi_1^0)\n\\land\n(\\mathrm{Decidable}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\Delta_1^0)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span>对应可枚举集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span>对应补集可枚举集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_1^0\">\\(\\Delta_1^0\\)</span>对应可判定集</li>\n<li>算术层级与递归论的关系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c78101abe1090034","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sigma1-set","status":"resolved","id":"fd611fa3b2c1a451","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sigma1-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-pi1-set","status":"resolved","id":"b952d88439f7be8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-pi1-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-delta1-set","status":"resolved","id":"0268c6eeaa40247a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-delta1-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c78101abe1090034","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp